hannel alerting & notifications, providing both automated and just in time communications that ensure teams remain prepared, informed, and effective in response efforts\r\n-\tDefense interoperability with JADC2, command-level systems, and DoW stakeholders\r\nBuilt by experienced professionals, UCP provides:\r\n-\tOff-the-shelf workflows + DesignStudio, a low-code/no-code workflow and form editor, reducing deployment time while enabling the clients to easily adapt to changing processes\r\n-\tMulti-channel alerts and notifications via text/SMS, mobile push, voice, email, platform inbox, Teams/Slack, and other webhook applications\r\n-\tA modern interface supporting single sign-on with PIV/CAC cards, role-based access and views, and integrated geospatial intelligence with Esri ArcGIS mapping\r\n-\tJuvare Exchange, a collaborative tool that allows for secure workflow, file sharing, and collaboration capabilities that can bridge across agencies and departments\r\n-\tJAI, a suite of AI-assisted capabilities that increase user efficiency with search, summarization, and data visualization, as well as performing a growing list of agentic tasks and automations\r\n-\tJuvare Analyze, a robust insights and analytics tool that helps users enhance their Common Operating Picture (COP), conduct multi-dataset visualizations, and perform time-series analyses \r\n-\tInvestigative Case Management System (ICMS) and Law Enforcement Availability Pay (LEAP), two powerful features that aid federal agents, OIGs, and OPRs in end-to-end investigative processes\r\n-\tIntegrated data from third-party platforms via Juvare Connectors, including CADs, threat intelligence systems, live video feeds, and other data sources\r\n-\tStreamlined data integrations from select partners, offering visibility and workflows for drone detection, advanced weather data, wildfire detection and response, all-weather observation using SAR/TAK, power outage management, and fleet/asset management","event_log":[{"date":"2